HDPR-8#1 Critical Warning
Reconfigurable logic that may need initialization  
Cell 'stereo_design_i/dense_fp32_0/U0/ap_CS_fsm_reg[0]' in Pblock 'pblock_model' has a INIT value of '1'b1' but without a reset. Without a reset the INIT value will not be loaded during Dynamic Function eXchange. To fix this issue do one of the following: 1) set the Pblock property RESET_AFTER_RECONFIG=TRUE on the Pblock. Using this constraint requires that the Pblock RANGEs be frame aligned. 2) add a reset to each cell that can be held during and released after a Dynamic Function eXchange.
